# Working notes between sessions — a record of what was measured and what fooled
# us, superseded the moment the next session measures again. Never part of the
# repository: what survives a handoff belongs in a README, a comment on the code
# it describes, or a test. Ignored rather than merely uncommitted so `git add -A`
# cannot quietly promote one to a permanent document.
*_handoff.md
